window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch252","pages":[{"n":1907,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图251.12\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1907-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图251.12\" width=\"972\" height=\"355\"></button><figcaption>图251.12 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1409\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第252 章libusb 库应用程序编写</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章将会对libusb 库中的一系列API 函数进行讲解，然后编写USB 实验程序对学习到的内容进行巩固。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1410\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">252.1 libusb 库API 讲解</h3>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1411\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.1 libusb_init 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:int libusb_init(libusb_context **ctx);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_init()函数用于初始化libusb 库。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_context **ctx：上下文指针，可为NULL 使用默认上下文。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0。失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1412\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.2 libusb_get_device_list 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:ssize_t libusb_get_device_list(libusb_context *ctx, libusb_device ***list)（2）函数作用:</p>"},{"n":1908,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_get_device_list()函数用于获取当前连接的USB 设备列表（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_context *ctx：上下文。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device ***list：输出设备指针数组。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回设备数量，负值表示错误。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1413\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.3 libusb_open_device_with_vid_pid 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:libusb_device_handle *libusb_open_device_with_vid_pid(libusb_context *ctx, uint16_t vid, uint16_t pid)（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_open_device_with_vid_pid()函数用来根据idVendor 和idProduct 的值打开对应USB设备。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_context *ctx：上下文。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device ***list：输出设备指针数组。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">uint16_t vid：要搜索的idVendor 值</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">uint16_t pid：要搜索的idProduct 值（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功返回设备句柄（libusb_device_handle *），失败返回NULL。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1414\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.4 libusb_open 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:int LIBUSB_CALL libusb_open(libusb_device *dev, libusb_device_handle **dev_handle);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_open()函数通过libusb_device 指针打开一个USB 设备，并返回一个libusb_device_h andle 句柄。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device *dev：要打开的USB 设备指针。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle **dev_handle：指向设备句柄的指针。（4）返回值:</p>"},{"n":1909,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1415\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.5 libusb_bulk_transfer 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int libusb_bulk_transfer(</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle *dev_handle,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char endpoint,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char *data,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int length,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int *actual_length,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned int timeout);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_bulk_transfer()函数用于USB 批量传输。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle **dev_handle：指向设备句柄的指针。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char endpoint：端点地址，最高位为1 表示输入。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char *data：发送或接收缓冲区指针。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int length：缓冲区长度。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int *actual_length：实际传输长度。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned int timeout：超时的毫秒数，0 表示永不超时</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1416\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.6 libusb_interrupt_transfer 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int libusb_interrupt_transfer(</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle *dev_handle,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char endpoint,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char *data,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int length,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int *actual_length,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned int timeout);</p>"},{"n":1910,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_interrupt_transfer()函数用于USB 中断传输。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle **dev_handle：指向设备句柄的指针。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char endpoint：端点地址，最高位为1 表示输入。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char *data：发送或接收缓冲区指针。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int length：缓冲区长度。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int *actual_length：实际传输长度。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned int timeout：超时的毫秒数，0 表示永不超时。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1417\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.7 libusb_get_config_descriptor 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int libusb_get_config_descriptor(</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device *dev,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">uint8_t config_index,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_config_descriptor **config);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_get_config_descriptor()函数用于根据索引值获取配置描述符。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device *dev：要读取的设备。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">uint8_t config_index：配置描述符的索引(一个USB 设备可能有多个配置)。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_config_descriptor **config：获取到的配置描述符（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1418\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.8 libusb_get_device_descriptor 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int libusb_get_device_descriptor(</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device *dev,</p>"},{"n":1911,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_device_descriptor *desc);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_get_device_descriptor()函数用于获取USB 设备描述符。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device *dev：要获取设备描述符的设备。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_device_descriptor *desc：获取到的设备描述符。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1419\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.9 libusb_free_device_list 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">void libusb_free_device_list(</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device **list,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int unref_devices);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_free_device_list()函数用于释放设备列表。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device **list：要释放的列表。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int unref_devices：如果设置成1，则设备的引用计数-1。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1420\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.10 libusb_free_config_descriptor 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:void libusb_free_config_descriptor(</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_config_descriptor *config);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_free_config_descriptor()函数用于释放配置描述符。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_config_descriptor *config：要释放的配置描述符。</p>"},{"n":1912,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1421\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.11 libusb_set_auto_detach_kernel_driver 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:int libusb_set_auto_detach_kernel_driver(</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle *dev_handle,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int enable);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_set_auto_detach_kernel_driver()函数用于设置自动卸载内核驱动。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle *dev_handle：已打开的USB 设备句柄。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int enable：启用(1)或禁用(0)自动分离功能。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1422\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.12 libusb_claim_interface 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int libusb_claim_interface(</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle *dev_handle,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int interface_number);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_claim_interface()函数用于给设备申请接口。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle *dev_handle：已打开的USB 设备句柄。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int interface_number：要声明的接口编号（从0 开始），对应接口描述符的bInterfaceNu mber 成员。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>"},{"n":1913,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1423\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.13 libusb_alloc_transfer 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:struct libusb_transfer *libusb_alloc_transfer( int iso_packets);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_alloc_transfer()函数用于分配一个用于异步传输的结构体，即libusb_transfer 结构体。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int iso_packets：等时传输包数量（非等时传输设为0）。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回struct libusb_transfer *结构体指针，失败时返回负数，表示具体的错误码。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1424\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.14 libusb_fill_interrupt_transfer 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">void libusb_fill_interrupt_transfer(</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_transfer *transfer,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle *dev_handle,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char endpoint,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char *buffer,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int length,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_transfer_cb_fn callback,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">void *user_data,</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned int timeout);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_fill_interrupt_transfer()函数用于配置一个异步中断传输对象。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_transfer *transfer：已分配的传输对象（需先通过libusb_alloc_transfer 分配）。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_device_handle *dev_handle: 已打开的USB 设备句柄。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char endpoint：端点地址。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned char *buffer：数据缓冲区指针。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int length：缓冲区长度（字节数）</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_transfer_cb_fn callback：传输完成时的回调函数。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">void *user_data：用户自定义数据（会传递给回调函数）。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unsigned int timeout：超时时间（毫秒，0 表示不超时），单位ms。</p>"},{"n":1914,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">无返回值。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1425\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.15 libusb_submit_transfer 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:int libusb_submit_transfer(struct libusb_transfer *transfer);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_submit_transfer()函数用于提交一个异步传输请求，传输完成或者出错时候调用回调函数进行处理。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_transfer *transfer：已通过libusb_fill_*_transfer 配置的传输对象。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功返回0，失败返回负数。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1426\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.16 libusb_cancel_transfer 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:int libusb_cancel_transfer(struct libusb_transfer *transfer);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_cancel_transfer()函数用于取消已提交但未完成的异步USB 传输。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_transfer *transfer：要取消的传输对象指针。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功返回0，失败返回负数。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1427\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.17 libusb_free_transfer 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:void libusb_free_transfer(struct libusb_transfer *transfer);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_free_transfer()函数用于释放传输结构。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">struct libusb_transfer *transfer：要取消的传输对象指针。</p>"},{"n":1915,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功返回0，失败返回负数。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1428\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.1.18 libusb_handle_events 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）函数原型:int libusb_handle_events(libusb_context *ctx);（2）函数作用:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_handle_events()函数用于在阻塞模式下处理任何待处理事件。（3）函数参数:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">libusb_context *ctx：libusb_context *ctx。（4）返回值:</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功返回0，失败返回负数。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1429\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">252.2 实验一</h3>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1430\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.2.1 应用程序编写</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本小节实验旨在实现一个基于libusb 库的USB 设备枚举程序，其核心功能为扫描并列出当前系统中所有已连接的USB 设备的基本信息。程序的执行流程如下：首先初始化libusb 库，接着获取USB 设备列表，遍历每个设备并读取其设备描述符，最终以&quot;厂商ID:产品ID&quot;的格式（如1234:5678）输出每个设备的标识信息。编写完成的测试例程存放路径为iTOP-RK3568开发板\\07_学习教程配套资料\\03_Linux 驱动配套资料\\04_Linux 驱动程序\\138_libusb_app，具体内容如代码清单252.1 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单252.1</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"10\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &quot;libusb.h&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">int main(void)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">       int ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">       int cnt;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">       libusb_device **device = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">       libusb_device *dev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">       int i = 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1915 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1915\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1916,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"11\" data-end=\"41\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">       // 初始化libusb 库</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">       ret = libusb_init(NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">       if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">           printf(&quot;libusb_init error \\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">           return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">       }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">       // 获取USB 设备列表</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">       cnt = libusb_get_device_list(NULL, &amp;device);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">       if (cnt &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">           printf(&quot;libusb_get_device_list error \\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">           return cnt;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">       }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">       // 遍历设备列表</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">       while (dev = device[i++]) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">           struct libusb_device_descriptor desc; // 设备描述符</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">           // 获取设备描述符</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">           ret = libusb_get_device_descriptor(dev, &amp;desc);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">           if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">                printf(&quot;libusb_get_device_descriptor error \\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">                return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">           }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">           // 打印厂商ID 和产品ID</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">           printf(&quot;%04x : %04x\\n&quot;, desc.idVendor, desc.idProduct);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">        }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">       // 释放设备列表</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">       libusb_free_device_list(device, 1);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">       libusb_exit(NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1916 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1916\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1431\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.2.2 编译应用程序</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">输入aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc usb.c -o usb -L./ -lusb-1.0 -lpthread -static 命令进行编译，编译完成以后会生成一个usb 的可执行程序，如图252.1 所示：</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图252.1\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1916-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图252.1\" width=\"981\" height=\"45\"></button><figcaption>图252.1 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1432\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.2.3 运行测试</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">开发板启动之后，运行编译得到的测试应用程序，运行结果如图252.2 所示：</p>"},{"n":1917,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图252.2\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1917-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图252.2\" width=\"974\" height=\"330\"></button><figcaption>图252.2 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">根据打印信息可以看到扫描并列出当前系统中所有已连接的USB 设备的基本信息。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1433\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">252.3 实验二</h3>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1434\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.3.1 应用程序编写</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本小节实验旨在实现了一个USB HID 键盘设备的监控程序，核心功能是检测并读取USB键盘的输入数据。程序执行流程如下：程序首先初始化libusb 库并枚举所有USB 设备，然后通过检查接口类(Class=3)和协议(Protocol=1)来识别HID 键盘设备；找到目标设备后，程序会打开设备并声明接口，进入一个无限循环，通过中断传输方式持续读取键盘数据。每次读取到数据时，程序会将接收到的16 字节键盘数据以十六进制格式打印输出。编写完成的测试例程存放路径为iTOP-RK3568 开发板\\07_学习教程配套资料\\03_Linux 驱动配套资料\\04_Linux 驱动程序\\139_libusb_app，具体内容如代码清单252.2 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单252.2</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &quot;libusb.h&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">int main(void)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 变量声明区</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int cnt;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    libusb_device **device = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    libusb_device *dev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int i = 0, k = 0, j = 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int endpoint;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int flag = 0;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1917 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1917\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1918,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"56\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct libusb_config_descriptor *config_desc = NULL; // USB 配置描述符</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">        const struct libusb_interface_descriptor *interface_descriptor = NULL; // 接口描述符</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">        libusb_device_handle *dev_handle = NULL;                         // USB 设备句柄</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">        unsigned char buffer[16];</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">        int transferred;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化 libusb 库</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = libusb_init(NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 printf(\"libusb 初始化失败\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">        }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 获取 USB 设备列表</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">        cnt = libusb_get_device_list(NULL, &amp;device);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (cnt &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 printf(\"获取设备列表失败\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 return cnt;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">        }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 遍历设备列表查找 HID 设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">        while (dev = device[i++]) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 获取设备配置描述符</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 ret = libusb_get_config_descriptor(dev, 0, &amp;config_desc);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">                               printf(\"获取配置描述符失败\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 遍历所有接口</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 for (k = 0; k &lt; config_desc-&gt;bNumInterfaces; k++) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         interface_descriptor = &amp;config_desc-&gt;interface[k].altsetting[0];</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         // 查找 HID 类设备(Class=3)且协议为键盘(Protocol=1)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         if (interface_descriptor-&gt;bInterfaceClass == 3 &amp;&amp;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 interface_descriptor-&gt;bInterfaceProtocol == 1) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 // 遍历端点查找中断输入端点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 for (j = 0; j &lt; interface_descriptor-&gt;bNumEndpoints; j++) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                          if ((interface_descriptor-&gt;endpoint[j].bmAttributes &amp; 3) ==</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">LIBUSB_TRANSFER_TYPE_INTERRUPT ||</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                  (interface_descriptor-&gt;endpoint[j].bmAttributes &amp; 0x80) ==</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">LIBUSB_ENDPOINT_IN) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                        endpoint = interface_descriptor-&gt;endpoint[j].bEndpointAddress;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                          flag = 1;    // 找到目标设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                          break;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                  }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                          }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 if (flag) break;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1918\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n"},{"n":1919,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"83\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\">            }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">            if (flag) break;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = libusb_open(dev, &amp;dev_handle);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62</span><span class=\"source-line\">        printf(&quot;打开设备失败\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65</span><span class=\"source-line\">        libusb_set_auto_detach_kernel_driver(dev_handle, 1);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66</span><span class=\"source-line\">        libusb_claim_interface(dev_handle, interface_descriptor-&gt;bInterfaceNumber);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67</span><span class=\"source-line\">        while (1) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68</span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 中断传输读取键盘数据</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69</span><span class=\"source-line\">            ret = libusb_interrupt_transfer(dev_handle, endpoint, buffer, 16, &amp;transferred, 5000);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70</span><span class=\"source-line\">            if (ret &gt;= 0) {  // 读取成功</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71</span><span class=\"source-line\">                // 打印接收到的键盘数据</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72</span><span class=\"source-line\">                for (i = 0; i &lt; transferred; i++) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73</span><span class=\"source-line\">               printf(&quot;%02x &quot;, buffer[i]);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74</span><span class=\"source-line\">            }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75</span><span class=\"source-line\">            printf(&quot;\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76</span><span class=\"source-line\">        }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 资源释放</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79</span><span class=\"source-line\">    libusb_free_config_descriptor(config_desc);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80</span><span class=\"source-line\">    libusb_free_device_list(device, 1);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81</span><span class=\"source-line\">    libusb_exit(NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1919 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1919\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1435\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.3.2 编译应用程序</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">输入aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc usb.c -o usb -L./ -lusb-1.0 -lpthread -static 命令进行编译，编译完成以后会生成一个名为usb 的可执行程序，编译完成如图252.3 所示：</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图252.3\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1919-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图252.3\" width=\"988\" height=\"47\"></button><figcaption>图252.3 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1436\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.3.3 运行测试</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">开发板启动之后，将USB 键盘插入iTOP-RK3568 开发板的usb 接口（注意不要使用和wifi），然后运行上节课编译得到的测试应用程序，然后点击数字键盘1-6，运行结果如图252.4 所示：</p>"},{"n":1920,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图252.4\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1920-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图252.4\" width=\"943\" height=\"227\"></button><figcaption>图252.4 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">根据打印信息可以看到检测并读取到了USB 键盘，每次按键时会在终端打印16 进制的键盘数据。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1437\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">252.4 实验三</h3>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1438\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.4.1 应用程序编写</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本小节实验借助libusb 库实现了对HID 键盘设备的异步数据监听。程序执行流程如下：首先初始化libusb 库并获取USB 设备列表，遍历查找HID 键盘设备及其中断输入端点；找到目标设备后，打开设备并设置自动卸载内核驱动，同时声明使用该接口；随后配置异步传输，在回调函数中处理接收到的数据，并重新提交传输请求以实现持续监听；最后通过while 事件循环处理USB 事件，达成对键盘数据的实时获取。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">编写完成的测试例程存放于路径iTOP-RK3568 开发板\\07_学习教程配套资料\\03_Linux 驱动配套资料\\04_Linux 驱动程序\\140_libusb_app 下，具体内容如代码清单252.3 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单252.3</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"13\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &quot;libusb.h&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct libusb_transfer *keyboard_transfer = NULL;  // 异步传输控制块</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">unsigned char buffer[16];  // 键盘数据接收缓冲区</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">int ret;  // 函数返回值存储</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 异步传输回调函数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">void callback_recv(struct libusb_transfer *transfer) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">  int k;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">  if (keyboard_transfer-&gt;status == LIBUSB_TRANSFER_COMPLETED) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">            if (transfer-&gt;actual_length &gt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">                // 打印接收到的键盘数据(16 进制)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">                for (k = 0; k &lt; transfer-&gt;actual_length; k++) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">                    printf(&quot;%02x &quot;, buffer[k]);</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1920 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1920\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1921,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"14\" data-end=\"57\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 printf(\"\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 重新提交传输请求(实现持续监听)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 ret = libusb_submit_transfer(keyboard_transfer);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         libusb_cancel_transfer(keyboard_transfer);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         libusb_free_transfer(keyboard_transfer);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">int main(void) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 int cnt;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 libusb_device **device = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 libusb_device *dev = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 int i = 0, k = 0, j = 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 int endpoint;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 int flag = 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 struct libusb_config_descriptor *config_desc = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 const struct libusb_interface_descriptor *interface_descriptor = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 libusb_device_handle *dev_handle = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 初始化 libusb 库</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 ret = libusb_init(NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         printf(\"libusb 初始化失败\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 获取 USB 设备列表</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 cnt = libusb_get_device_list(NULL, &amp;device);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 if (cnt &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         printf(\"获取设备列表失败\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         return cnt;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 遍历设备查找 HID 键盘</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 while ((dev = device[i++])) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         ret = libusb_get_config_descriptor(dev, 0, &amp;config_desc);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 printf(\"获取配置描述符失败\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         // 遍历所有接口</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         for (k = 0; k &lt; config_desc-&gt;bNumInterfaces; k++) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 interface_descriptor = &amp;config_desc-&gt;interface[k].altsetting[0];</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 if (interface_descriptor-&gt;bInterfaceClass == 3 &amp;&amp;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1921\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n\n"},{"n":1922,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"101\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                          interface_descriptor-&gt;bInterfaceProtocol == 1) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                          for (j = 0; j &lt; interface_descriptor-&gt;bNumEndpoints; j++) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                  if ((interface_descriptor-&gt;endpoint[j].bmAttributes &amp; 3) ==</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><span class=\"source-line\">LIBUSB_TRANSFER_TYPE_INTERRUPT ||</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                          (interface_descriptor-&gt;endpoint[j].bmAttributes &amp; 0x80) ==</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63</span><span class=\"source-line\">LIBUSB_ENDPOINT_IN) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                          endpoint = interface_descriptor-&gt;endpoint[j].bEndpointAddress;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                          flag = 1;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                          break;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                  }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                          }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 if (flag) break;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         if (flag) break;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 打开找到的键盘设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 ret = libusb_open(dev, &amp;dev_handle);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         printf(\"打开设备失败\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 libusb_set_auto_detach_kernel_driver(dev_handle, 1);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">818</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 libusb_claim_interface(dev_handle, interface_descriptor-&gt;bInterfaceNumber);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 keyboard_transfer = libusb_alloc_transfer(0);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 libusb_fill_interrupt_transfer(</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">84</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         keyboard_transfer, dev_handle, endpoint,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">85</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         buffer, 16, callback_recv, NULL, 5000);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">86</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 提交异步传输请求</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">87</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 ret = libusb_submit_transfer(keyboard_transfer);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">88</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">89</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         libusb_cancel_transfer(keyboard_transfer);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">90</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         libusb_free_transfer(keyboard_transfer);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">91</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">92</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">93</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">94</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 主事件循环(处理 USB 事件)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">95</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 while (1) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">96</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         libusb_handle_events(NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">97</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">98</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 libusb_free_config_descriptor(config_desc);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">99</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 libusb_free_device_list(device, 1);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">100</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 libusb_exit(NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">101</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 return 0;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1922\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n\n"},{"n":1923,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"102\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">102</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1923 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1923\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1439\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.4.2 编译应用程序</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">输入aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc usb.c -o usb -L./ -lusb-1.0 -lpthread -static 命令进行编译，编译完成以后会生成一个名为usb 的可执行程序，编译完成如图252.5 所示：</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图252.5\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1923-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图252.5\" width=\"977\" height=\"42\"></button><figcaption>图252.5 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1440\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">252.4.3 运行测试</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">开发板启动之后，将USB 键盘插入iTOP-RK3568 开发板的usb 接口，然后运行上节课编译得到的测试应用程序，点击数字键盘1-6，运行结果如图252.6 所示：</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图252.6\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1923-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图252.6\" width=\"971\" height=\"254\"></button><figcaption>图252.6 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">根据打印信息可以看到检测并读取到了USB 键盘，每次按键时会在终端打印16 进制的键盘数据。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1441\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第253 章USB 驱动开发框架</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在Linux 内核中，USB 驱动开发主要分为两类：主机（Host）端驱动程序与设备（Device）端驱动程序。主机端的驱动程序负责管控插入主机的USB 设备；设备端的驱动程序负责该设备作为USB 设备与主机通信的方式。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在硬件层面，主机侧和设备侧的USB 控制器，分别被称作主机控制器（Host Controller）与USB 设备控制器（UDC），USB 驱动框架如图253.1 所示：</p>"}]});
